### 1. Calculate a Fare
POST http://localhost:8082/api/fares/calculate?rideId=1&distanceInKm=12.5&durationInMinutes=25

### 2. Get Fare by Ride ID
GET http://localhost:8082/api/fares/ride/1

### 3. Process a Payment
POST http://localhost:8082/api/payments/process?rideId=1&passengerId=101&amount=1175.00&paymentMethod=CARD

### 4. Get Payments by Passenger ID
GET http://localhost:8082/api/payments/passenger/101

### 5. Get Payments by Ride ID
GET http://localhost:8082/api/payments/ride/1